// --- Skill trees --------------------------------------------------------
// Tiers are named, not numbered: a tier is referenced by id, its gate lives in
// one place, and inserting a tier renumbers nothing. Specs are ids too, so a
// spec can be renamed or reordered without touching the nodes inside it.
const MEND_HEAL = 9; // retired by #40 (healing scales off Magic now); kept as a slice anchor
// What a mend actually restores. It is the power behind the caster's blow --
