// snow on land, ice over water. Returns the changed unit and the ground to
// lay, so the player's move and the enemy's agree by construction.
// A harm taken during your own phase is docked a turn the moment that phase
// closes, because the clock runs at the close. Everything walked into is
// exactly that case: the jaws hold a fighter for three turns when the words
// say three, but the ground took one back the instant they finished moving,
